OL,3,GNEWSADoctor's appointment phone call
OL,4,Aled to data breach
OL,5,
OL,6,FA doctor exposed confidential medical
OL,7,Finformation when taking a phone call
OL,8,Fwhile examining a patient, a watchdog
OL,9,Fhas revealed.
OL,11,FThe Office of the Data Protection
OL,12,FAuthority (ODPA) said "identifying
OL,13,Fdetails and sensitive health
OL,14,Finformation" about another person were
OL,15,Foverheard during the call.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
