OL,3,GNEWSADoctor's appointment phone call
OL,4,Aled to data breach
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe watchdog highlighted the incident
OL,7,Fas it reported a fall in serious data
OL,8,Fbreaches in Guernsey during the second
OL,9,Fquarter of 2026. The authority said the
OL,10,Fdisclosure created a "risk of distress
OL,11,Fand loss of privacy" for the person
OL,12,Fconcerned.
OL,14,FData protection commissioner Brent
OL,15,FHoman said "breaches are not just about
OL,16,Frecords, but include overheard
OL,17,Fconversations".
